OL,3,GNEWSACricket pitch plan for site on
OL,4,Awaste dump watchlist
OL,5,
OL,6,FRetrospective planning permission is
OL,7,Fbeing sought for a cricket pitch built
OL,8,Fat a site on a national watchlist of
OL,9,Fwaste dumps causing concern.
OL,11,FThe pitch is on green belt land at Oak
OL,12,FTree Farm in Binfield, Berkshire, and
OL,13,Fused by Bracknell Cricket Club.
OL,15,FIn May, the Environment Agency said it
OL,16,Fwanted to prosecute "the shameless
OL,17,Fpeople" who had left a reported 100,000
OL,18,Ftonnes of rubbish at the site, adding
OL,19,Fit to a list of high priority locations
OL,20,Fit monitors closely.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,332,330,200,160,0,100
