OL,3,GNEWSACricket pitch plan for site on
OL,4,Awaste dump watchlist
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut planning agents said the farm was
OL,7,F"particularly well suited to cricket"
OL,8,Fand the project was "driven by the need
OL,9,Fto secure a permanent and sustainable
OL,10,Fhome for the club".
